n\n### SVG offset diagram\n- [ ] Produce hand-authored SVG — top, side, and front views with all sensor frames and key dimensions labeled\n- [ ] Commit at `bizzyboat_project11/docs/bizzyboat_offsets.svg`\n- [ ] Verify renders cleanly on GitHub\n\n### URDF\nUpdate `bizzyboat_project11/urdf/sensors/`:\n- [ ] Update `sonar.xacro` → M3 transducer frame\n- [ ] Add `sbg.xacro` (IMU body + 2 antenna frames)\n- [ ] Add `svs.xacro` (sampling point)\n- [ ] Wire new sensors into `bizzyboat.urdf.xacro`\n- [ ] Verify visually in RViz; check `ros2 run tf2_tools view_frames` output\n\n## Success criteria\n\n1. All new sensors appear in reference geometry doc with [MEAS] status where feasible, citing manual/photos\n2. SVG diagram committed and viewable on GitHub\n3. URDF reflects installed geometry, tf tree validated\n\nPart of #57\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)`","files":null}]}